    schema1:dateModified "2021-09-03T00:00:00.000Z" ;
    schema1:description "Applies a list of mutations over the initial structure obtaining a set of structures (initial structure + one mutation, initial structure + two mutations, initial structure + three mutations, ...). Finally performs a system setup and runs a molecular dynamics simulation for each of the structures in the set." ;
