* [NCBI nucleotide non-redundant sequences for decontamination with Centrifuge](http://www.ccb.jhu.edu/software/centrifuge)\r
* [RepBase v17.02 file RMRBSeqs.embl](https://www.girinst.org/repbase)\r
\r
### Installation\r
