    schema1:dateCreated "2021-09-15T17:27:55Z" ;
    schema1:dateModified "2021-09-15T17:28:33Z" ;
    schema1:description "BioTranslator performs sequentially pathway analysis and gene prioritization: A specific operator is executed for each task to translate the input gene set into semantic terms and pinpoint the pivotal-role genes on the derived semantic network. The output consists of the set of statistically significant semantic terms and the associated hub genes (the gene signature), prioritized according to their involvement in the underlying semantic topology." ;
    schema1:image <arcp://uuid,07e34484-d75f-5d01-9069-78038729667d/image.png> ;
