This workflow expects an (annotated) genome in GBOL ttl format.\r
\r
Steps:\r
  - SAPP: rdf2gtf (genome fasta)\r
  - SAPP: rdf2fasta (transcripts fasta)\r
  - STAR index (Optional for Eukaryotic origin)\r
  - bowtie2 index\r
  - kallisto index\r
""" ;
