    schema1:description """Workflow for sequencing with ONT nanopore, from basecalling to assembly quality.\r
Steps:\r
  - Kraken2 (taxonomic classification of FASTQ reads)\r
  - Krona (classification visualization)\r
  - Flye (de novo assembly)\r
  - Medaka (assembly polishing)\r
  - QUAST (assembly quality reports)\r
""" ;
