    schema1:description """PAIRED-END workflow. Align reads on fasta reference/assembly using bwa mem, get a consensus, variants, mutation explanations.\r
\r
IMPORTANT: \r
* For "bcftools call" consensus step, the --ploidy file is in "Données partagées" (Shared Data) and must be imported in your history to use the worflow by providing this file (tells bcftools to consider haploid variant calling). \r
* SELECT THE MOST ADAPTED VADR MODEL for annotation (see vadr parameters).\r
""" ;
