    schema1:description "Analysis of S-protein polymorphism. This workflow includes: obtaining coding sequences of S proteins from a diverse group of coronaviruses and generating amino acid alignments to assess conservation of the polymorphic location. More info can be found at https://covid19.galaxyproject.org/genomics/" ;
