        <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9524-5964>,
        <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5516-8391> ;
    schema1:creativeWorkStatus "Work-in-progress" ;
    schema1:description """### Workflow for LongRead Quality Control and Filtering\r
\r
- NanoPlot  (read quality control) before and after filtering\r
- Filtlong  (read trimming)\r
- Kraken2 taxonomic read classification before and after filtering\r
- Minimap2 read filtering based on given references<br><br>\r
\r
Other UNLOCK workflows on WorkflowHub: https://workflowhub.eu/projects/16/workflows?view=default<br><br>\r
\r
**All tool CWL files and other workflows can be found here:**<br>\r
https://gitlab.com/m-unlock/cwl/workflows\r
\r
**How to setup and use an UNLOCK workflow:**<br>\r
https://m-unlock.gitlab.io/docs/setup/setup.html<br>\r
""" ;
