    schema1:description """Workflow for Metagenomics from raw reads to annotated bins.\r
Steps:\r
  - workflow_quality.cwl:\r
      - FastQC (control)\r
      - fastp (trimming)\r
  - Kraken2 (Taxonomic Read Classification\r
  - SPAdes (Assembly)\r
  - QUAST (Assembly quality report)\r
  - BBmap (Read mapping to assembly)\r
  - sam_to_bam (sam to indexed bam)\r
  - metabatContigDepths (jgi_summarize_bam_contig_depths)\r
  - MetaBat2 (binning)\r
""" ;
