\r
\r
### Filtering by text mining on scientific papers (second filtering part) - File ````ppi_pubminer/pubmed_pmc_literature_pipeline.py````:\r
\r
* Pipeline parameters:\r
	- __-em__ or __--execution_mode__ <br>\r
		Use to indicate the execution mode desired: <br>\r
		1 - Mode using a list of protein pairs as bait <br>\r
