This tutorial aims to illustrate how to compute a **fast-growth mutation free energy** calculation, step by step, using the BioExcel **Building Blocks library (biobb)**. The particular example used is the **Staphylococcal nuclease** protein (PDB code 1STN), a small, minimal protein, appropriate for a short tutorial.\r
