    schema1:description """[![GitHub Actions CI Status](https://github.com/plant-food-research-open/assemblyqc/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/plant-food-research-open/assemblyqc/actions/workflows/ci.yml)\r
