        <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9524-5964> ;
    schema1:creativeWorkStatus "Work-in-progress" ;
    schema1:description """### Workflow for Metagenomics binning from assembly\r
\r
**Minimal inputs are: Identifier, assembly (fasta) and a associated sorted BAM file**\r
\r
**Summary**\r
  - MetaBAT2 (binning)\r
  - MaxBin2 (binning)\r
  - SemiBin (binning)\r
  - DAS Tool (bin merging)\r
  - EukRep (eukaryotic classification)\r
  - CheckM (bin completeness and contamination)\r
  - BUSCO (bin completeness)\r
  - GTDB-Tk (bin taxonomic classification)\r
\r
Other UNLOCK workflows on WorkflowHub: https://workflowhub.eu/projects/16/workflows?view=default<br><br>\r
\r
**All tool CWL files and other workflows can be found here:**<br>\r
  Tools: https://gitlab.com/m-unlock/cwl<br>\r
  Workflows: https://gitlab.com/m-unlock/cwl/workflows<br>\r
\r
**How to setup and use an UNLOCK workflow:**<br>\r
https://m-unlock.gitlab.io/docs/setup/setup.html<br>\r
""" ;
