    schema1:description """Galaxy Workflow created on Galaxy-E european instance, ecology.usegalaxy.eu, related to the Galaxy training tutorial "[Biodiversity data exploration](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/topics/ecology/tutorials/biodiversity-data-exploration/tutorial.html)"\r
