14. Detection of super-enhancer regions (Rank Ordering of Super-Enhancers; ROSE)\r
15. Differential binding analyses (DiffBind) for:\r
 - MACS2 peak calling results\r
 - ROSE-detected super-enhancer regions \r
 """ ;
