According to the current ZARP implementation, reads are analyzed (pre-processed, aligned, quantified) with state-of-the-art\r
tools to give meaningful initial insights into the quality and composition of an RNA-Seq library, reducing hands-on time for bioinformaticians and giving experimentalists the possibility to rapidly assess their data. Additional reports summarise the results of the individual steps and provide useful visualisations.\r
\r
