* (c) 2015-2022 [Institute for Research in Biomedicine](https://www.irbbarcelona.org/)\r
\r
Licensed under the\r
[Apache License 2.0](https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0), see the file LICENSE for details.\r
\r
![](https://bioexcel.eu/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/Bioexcell_logo_1080px_transp.png "Bioexcel")""" ;
