\r
If you use sanger-tol/insdcdownload for your analysis, please cite it using the following doi: [10.5281/zenodo.7155119](https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7155119)\r
\r
An extensive list of references for the tools used by the pipeline can be found in the [`CITATIONS.md`](CITATIONS.md) file.\r
\r
