    schema1:author <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9906-0673> ;
    schema1:description """Data QC step, can run alone or as part of a combined workflow for large genome assembly. \r
\r
* What it does: Reports statistics from sequencing reads.\r
* Inputs: long reads (fastq.gz format), short reads (R1 and R2) (fastq.gz format).\r
* Outputs: For long reads: a nanoplot report (the HTML report summarizes all the information). For short reads: a MultiQC report.\r
* Tools used: Nanoplot, FastQC, MultiQC.\r
* Input parameters: None required.\r
* Workflow steps: Long reads are analysed by Nanoplot; Short reads (R1 and R2) are analysed by FastQC; the resulting reports are processed by MultiQC.\r
* Options: see the tool settings options at runtime and change as required. Alternative tool option: fastp\r
\r
Infrastructure_deployment_metadata: Galaxy Australia (Galaxy)\r
""" ;
    schema1:hasPart <arcp://uuid,a5d715af-3076-58d7-9a73-68ddc5a13a59/DataQC.png>,
