```\r
This will generate a consensus sequence in FASTA format for each of your samples and place them in `/results/consensus_sequences/.masked.fasta`. An HTML report containing alignment and quality metrics for your samples can be found at `/results/reports/qc_report.html`. A phylogeny comparing your sequences to the background dataset can be found at `/results/phylogeny/phylogeny.tree`\r
""" ;
