\r
1) ISEScan v1.7.2.3 [Xie et al., Bioinformatics, 2017](https://doi.org/10.1093/bioinformatics/btx433)\r
2) IntegronFinder2 v2.0.2 [Néron et al., Microorganisms, 2022](https://doi.org/10.3390/microorganisms10040700)\r
3) ICEfinder v1.0 [Liu et al., Nucleic Acids Research, 2019](https://doi.org/10.1093/nar/gky1123)\r
4) PaliDIS [Carr et al., biorxiv, 2022](https://doi.org/10.1101/2022.06.27.497710)\r
\r
Databases:\r
- MobileOG-DB Beatrix 1.6 v1 [Brown et al., Appl Environ Microbiol, 2022](https://doi.org/10.1128/aem.00991-22)\r
""" ;
