	9. Download SPRINT pre-computed similarities in https://www.csd.uwo.ca/~ilie/SPRINT/precomputed_similarities.zip and unzip it inside workflow_hpAugmentation/predprin/core/sprint/HSP/\r
	10. ````cd workflow_hpAugmentation/predprin/````\r
