        <https://github.com/bioexcel/biobb_wf_amber_md_setup/blob/master/conda_env/environment.macos.yml>,
        <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bioexcel/biobb_wf_amber_md_setup/master/biobb_wf_amber_md_setup/notebooks/abcsetup/ABCix_config_files/md.in>,
