    schema1:creativeWorkStatus "Stable" ;
    schema1:description """# Protein Conformational Transitions calculations tutorial using BioExcel Building Blocks (biobb) and GOdMD\r
\r
This tutorial aims to illustrate the process of computing a conformational transition between two known structural conformations of a protein, step by step, using the BioExcel Building Blocks library (biobb).\r
\r
***\r
