    schema1:author <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8293-4816> ;
    schema1:description """## Purge dups\r
\r
This snakemake pipeline is designed to be run using as input a contig-level genome and pacbio reads. This pipeline has been tested with `snakemake v7.32.4`. Raw long-read sequencing files and the input contig genome assembly must be given in the `config.yaml` file. To execute the workflow run:\r
\r
`snakemake --use-conda --cores N`\r
\r
Or configure the cluster.json and run using the `./run_cluster` command""" ;
    schema1:hasPart <arcp://uuid,e0bcbc2a-b29b-5432-a5db-1c5115d1d209/Snakefile>,
