N E X T F L O W  ~  version 19.07.0\r
Launching `main.nf` [intergalactic_shannon] - revision: e707c77d7b\r
\r
Usage:\r
    nextflow main.nf --input_files input_files [--reference reference.fasta]\r
\r
Input:\r
    * input_fastq1: the path to a FASTQ file (incompatible with --input_files)\r
    * input_files: the path to a tab-separated values file containing in each row the sample name and two paired FASTQs (incompatible with --fastq1 and --fastq2)\r
    when `--library paired`, or a single FASTQ file when `--library single`\r
    Example input file:\r
