        <https://github.com/bioexcel/biobb_workflows/blob/master/biobb_wf_virtual_screening/python/all_pockets.zip>,
        <https://github.com/bioexcel/biobb_workflows/blob/master/biobb_wf_virtual_screening/python/ligand.pdb>,
