        <https://github.com/bioexcel/biobb_workflows/blob/master/biobb_wf_dna_helparms/python/topology.top>,
        <https://github.com/bioexcel/biobb_workflows/blob/master/biobb_wf_dna_helparms/python/trajectory.nc>,
