\r
Stacks: http://catchenlab.life.illinois.edu/stacks/\r
\r
This workflow is part of the reference-guided stacks workflow, https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/347\r
\r
 This workflow takes in bam files and a population map. \r
\r
To generate bam files see: https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/351\r
""" ;
