        <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9524-5964> ;
    schema1:creativeWorkStatus "Work-in-progress" ;
    schema1:description """Workflow for Metagenomics from raw reads to bins.\r
\r
**Steps:**\r
\r
*   workflow_quality.cwl:\r
\r
  *       FastQC (control)\r
\r
  *       fastp (quality trimming)\r
\r
  *       bbmap contamination filter\r
\r
*   SPAdes (Assembly)\r
\r
*   QUAST (Assembly quality report)\r
\r
*   BBmap (Read mapping to assembly)\r
\r
*   MetaBat2 (binning)\r
\r
*   CheckM (bin completeness and contamination)\r
\r
*   GTDB-Tk (bin taxonomic classification)\r
\r
""" ;
