* optional inputs of SAK info and sequence graph have been removed\r
* the required input format for the genome is changed from gfa to fasta\r
* the estimated genome size now requires user input rather than being extracted from output of a previous workflow.  \r
\r
Inputs: \r
\r
* assembly.fasta  [note - scaffolding is done only one haplotype at a time. eg hap1 or primary]\r
* Concatenated HiC forward reads in fastqsanger.gz\r
* Concatenated HiC reverse reads in fastqsanger.gz\r
* Restriction enzyme sequence\r
* Estimated genome size (enter as integer)\r
* Lineage for busco \r
\r
Outputs: the main outputs are: \r
\r
* scaffolded_assmbly.fasta\r
* comparison of pre- post- scaffolding contact maps\r
\r
\r
\r
\r
""" ;
