        <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4308-5617> ;
    schema1:description """\r
\r
Galaxy Workflow created on Galaxy-E european instance, ecology.usegalaxy.eu, related to the Galaxy training tutorial "Antarctic sea ecoregionalization" .\r
\r
This workflow allows to analyze marine benthic biodiversity data to compute ecoregions regarding environmental data.\r
""" ;
    schema1:hasPart <arcp://uuid,ff7cc2f1-1440-5324-8f1b-0c50450caaef/Galaxy-Workflow-Ecoregionalization_on_Antarctic_sea.ga> ;
