<arcp://uuid,afbbdabe-adcb-5460-b395-7466c3eadaf5/> a schema1:Dataset ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/ro/wfrun/process/0.1>,
        <https://w3id.org/ro/wfrun/workflow/0.1>,
        <https://w3id.org/workflowhub/workflow-ro-crate/1.0> ;
    schema1:creator <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6401-6229> ;
    schema1:datePublished "2023-11-16T14:25:14+00:00" ;
    schema1:description """**Contact Person:** support-compss@bsc.es  
**Access Level:** public  
**License Agreement:** Apache2  
**Platform:** COMPSs  

# Description

Simple is an application that takes one value and increases it by five units. The purpose of this application is to show how tasks are managed by COMPSs.

# Execution instructions
Usage:
```
runcompss --lang=python src/simple.py initValue
```

where:
* initValue: Initial value for counter

# Execution Examples
```
runcompss --lang=python src/simple.py 1
runcompss src/simple.py 1
python -m pycompss src/simple.py 1
```

# Build
No build is required
""" ;
    schema1:hasPart <arcp://uuid,afbbdabe-adcb-5460-b395-7466c3eadaf5/App_Profile.json>,
