<arcp://uuid,c99d12ab-3bc3-5c6e-b8b2-e3af74269b4b/> a schema1:Dataset ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/ro/wfrun/process/0.1>,
        <https://w3id.org/ro/wfrun/workflow/0.1>,
        <https://w3id.org/workflowhub/workflow-ro-crate/1.0> ;
    schema1:creator <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-1637-4487> ;
    schema1:datePublished "2024-04-19T08:05:56+00:00" ;
    schema1:description """**Name:** Incrementation and Fibonacci     
**Access Level**: public  
**License Agreement**: Apache2  
**Platform**: COMPSs  

# Description
**Brief Overview:** Demonstrates COMPSs task parallelism with increment and Fibonacci computations.

**Detailed Description:**
 Performs multiple increments of input values in parallel using COMPSs.
 Concurrently calculates Fibonacci numbers using recursive COMPSs tasks.
 Demonstrates task synchronization via `compss_wait_on`.

# Execution instructions
Usage:
```
runcompss src/increment_fibonacci.py value1 Value2 Value3 
#add more values if you want

```

# Execution Examples
```
runcompss src/increment_fibonacci.py 1 4 3 9 6 9 

```

# Build
No build is required
""" ;
    schema1:hasPart <arcp://uuid,c99d12ab-3bc3-5c6e-b8b2-e3af74269b4b/App_Profile.json>,
