    schema1:description "This publication corresponds to the Research Objects (RO) of the Baseline Use Case proposed in T.5.2 (WP5) in the BY-COVID project on “COVID-19 Vaccine(s) effectiveness in preventing SARS-CoV-2 infection”." ;
